  "metadata_synthesis": "Released in 1989 under the distinct directorial vision of Peter Weir, this international Comedy/Drama work serves as a vital cultural document, anchoring the viewer in a precise historical and artistic context. Starring Robin Williams and Robert Sean Leonard, it bridges mainstream appeal with raw thematic ambition.",
